      "subject": "ותטהו לה אל הצור",
      "rationale": "Kwagatenia kĩngoothi kwe ihiga-inĩ: ũrĩa wa kũhinga matũũra-meecio, kana wa kuuma-kwe o mwene — matuku ma mbere nĩmeugaga wa mbeere."
