    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "kuuma mũgĩmbĩ wa kũunĩka kinya mai makĩrũgũkwo",
      "rationale": "Kĩhooto kĩa ihinda: kuuma mũgĩmbĩ wa kũunĩka kinya mbura ĩagĩre — kĩndũ gĩa kũiganĩra."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "יומם \/ לילה",
      "rationale": "Kwarĩrĩranĩria kwa mũthenya na kĩro — mĩena ĩĩrĩ ĩrĩa ĩthingatĩtie mũthenya wothe."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ricipa mũirĩtu wa Aya nĩagwatire ⟨את⟩ kĩngoothi, nĩagateniire kwe ihiga-inĩ, kuuma mũgĩmbĩ wa kũunĩka kinya mai makĩrũgũkwo he kuuma igũrũ; ndarehirie cienji cia igũrũ kũhũrũka ha icio mũthenya, na ⟨את⟩ nyamu cia gĩthaka kĩro.",
